OL,3,GNEWSAShocked NHS colleagues grieve
OL,4,A'exceptional doctor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe colleagues of a GP found dead at
OL,7,Fher home have spoken of their profound
OL,8,Fshock at the loss of an "exceptional
OL,9,Fdoctor".
OL,11,FHannah Cain, 45, known to her patients
OL,12,Fas Dr Hannah Terry, was found at a
OL,13,Fproperty in Fern Hill, Dersingham,
OL,14,FNorfolk, on Sunday. Her husband, Mark
OL,15,FCain, is due at King's Lynn Crown Court
OL,16,Flater, charged with her murder.
OL,18,FThe GP was based at Grimston Medical
OL,19,FCentre and had previously been at
OL,20,FHeacham Group Practice for several
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
