OL,3,GNEWSAShocked NHS colleagues grieve
OL,4,A'exceptional doctor'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have lost an outstanding doctor, a
OL,7,Fcherished colleague and a friend, and
OL,8,Fher absence will be felt deeply across
OL,9,Four health community," said a statement
OL,10,Fissued on behalf of primary care
OL,11,Forganisations across west Norfolk.
